<figure id="A2.F2" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2012.00614v2/claimscatter.jpg" id="A2.F2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:333/294;" width="333" height="294" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 2: </span> Scatter plot showing a two-dimensional embedding of the 1535 climate claims using <span id="A2.F2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">umap</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">19</a>]</cite> for dimensionality reduction. The cluster assignments were computed using the density based <span id="A2.F2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">dbscan</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">21</a>]</cite> algorithm performed on 30-dimensional <span id="A2.F2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">umap</span> embeddings.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span> Shows an overview about the different clusters found in the 1,535 climate claims. The cluster numbers correspond to the cluster numbers in Fig. <a href="#A2.F2" title="Figure 2 ‣ Appendix B Topic distribution ‣ climate-fever: A Dataset for Verification of Real-World Climate Claims" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>. The first column denotes the cluster, second column shows how many documents belong to said cluster. The last column lists the top-5 terms in the cluster as measured with respect to term-frequency.</figcaption>
