<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Baseline evaluation</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To evaluate a baseline system on <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">climate-fever</span>, we trained a claim validation system on the <span id="A3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">fever</span> task reaching a competitive label-accuracy of 77.58% on the <span id="A3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">fever</span> dev-set. The final entailment prediction task was formulated as a three-way classifier predicting label <span id="A3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">SUPPORTS</span>, <span id="A3.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">REFUTES</span> or <span id="A3.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">NOT_ENOUGH_INFO</span> based on the claim and a concatenation of all evidence sentences (were we prepended the Wikipedia article title to each evidence sentence to resolve missing co-references). Tables <a href="#A3.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix C Baseline evaluation ‣ climate-fever: A Dataset for Verification of Real-World Climate Claims" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> and <a href="#A3.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix C Baseline evaluation ‣ climate-fever: A Dataset for Verification of Real-World Climate Claims" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> compare the performance of the claim validator evaluated on <span id="A3.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">climate-fever</span> and on the <span id="A3.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">fever</span> dev-set.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span> Classification report with respect to the performance of the baseline claim validation pipeline evaluated on <span id="A3.T4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">climate-fever</span>. These values are contrasted (in parentheses) with the reported values from the evaluation on the original <span id="A3.T4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">fever</span> dev-set. All values are reported as percentages.</figcaption>
